      "query": "{\"content\": \"Distributed once so far; expect no further relists before a decision on the petition. The case is a poor vehicle for reviewing judicial disqualification standards, as the lower court denied the petition on state-law timeliness and sufficiency grounds. There will be no call for the views of the Solicitor General (CVSG), as the case involves a local nuisance dispute with no federal interest implicated. \\n\\nIf granted, the Court would take the sole question presented as written regardi",
